{
  "comment": "Why: a city of the dead is a place where nothing has ever left. The table is the dead, in the order a visitor meets them: the shamblers at the threshold, the ghouls in the loculi, the rattle of a procession, a death knight in the mausoleum, the ossuary that stands up when the party is loud. The dark is their friend (several entries need it), the abyssal bonus makes the whole road hunt a little, and the first sector gets only the quiet end of it.",
  "description": "Sandstone, bone block and ghost-green light: catacombs, mausoleums and bone bridges over an abyss. The dead are patient, they are many, and they walk in order.",
